1. **(Hours 0-3) Triage & Planning (Architect):** Analyze and group the 100 services, identifying patterns and dependencies. Output a manifest defining the migration strategy and workstreams.

2. **(Hours 1-8) Parallelized Automation Setup (DevOps):** Create standardized Dockerfile templates, script 100 Google Cloud Build triggers, and develop parameterized Terraform modules for Cloud Run, VPC Access, and IAM.

